# The Castle — custom guided meditation inside Focus 27, shared cohort scenario.
# Was levels.json "C27-CASTLE" until 2026-08-19; its beat/carrier/bed were F27's
# own, verbatim, because it never was a separate level.
# v1 note carried over: "shared render, identical across cohort; translation
# layer active"
#
# Content authored 2026-08-19 from the user's own account: the Place of Your
# Own grown into an educational/research edition for co-working with entities
# and individuals of equal or greater development -- many rooms, each larger
# inside than out, the unvisited ones held by a version of the listener (the
# user's own multi-core / CIA-compartmentalisation framing, kept verbatim
# rather than reworded). Follows place-of-your-own directly, the way the
# castle grows out of what is already there.

@title    Focus 27 — The Castle
@level    F10
@ending   stay
@pan      right
@seed     2728
@verbosity 3

surf 0.55
use opening
use comfort
use orientation
use ocean

surf 0.30
use conversion-box
use affirmation

surf 0.18
use resonant-tuning
use balloon
use return-methods
use clear-skies

surf 0.0
use relax-10

use climb-f10-f12
use briefing-f12
use free

use climb-f12-f15
use briefing-f15
use free

use climb-f15-f21
use briefing-f21

use climb-f21-f23
use briefing-f23

use climb-f23-f25
use briefing-f25

use climb-f25-f26
use briefing-f26

use climb-f26-f27
use briefing-f27

bed 0.38 0.03
use place-of-your-own
use affirmation-service
use castle
use stay
